    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maloŵe gakumalisya ga Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aga ni maloŵe ga kumalisya ga Daudi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Aji ni nyimbo ja Daudi, mwanace jwa Yese, maloŵe ga mundu juŵamŵisile Mlungu penani, jwele Mlungu ja Yakobo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵamsagwile kuti aŵe mwenye, mundu jwakunonyelwa kwimba nyimbo syakusalala sya Aisalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŵa ngondo ŵakupikanika ŵa Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga mena ga ŵandu ŵa ngondo ŵamacili ŵa Daudi: Yoshebu Bashebeti, ŵa ku Takemoni, jwamkulungwa jwa ŵa ngondo ŵatatu. Ŵele ŵiŵamenyene ngondo ni ŵandu 800, ni ŵawuleje wosope ni lipanga lwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵiŵakuyaga panyuma pawo mwa ŵandu ŵatatu ŵamacili ŵala ŵaliji Eliyesa, mwanace jwa Dodo, mwanace jwa Aho. Ŵelewo ŵaliji ni Daudi ndaŵi jiŵatandaga Afilisiti ŵiŵasongene kuti amenyane nawo ngondo ku Pasi Damimu. Aisalaeli ŵaliji ali atisile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Eliyesa ŵasigalile, ni ŵatasile ngondo Afilisiti mpaka mkono ŵakwe watesile mandilindili, nambo upanga wakwe nganiwugwa. Lisiku lyelelyo AMBUJE ŵapundisye ku amagongo ŵawo. Panyuma pakwe Aisalaeli ŵayice kuŵaliji Eliyesa kujigala yida ya ŵandu ŵawewo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵiŵaliji panyuma pa Eliyesa ni Sama, mwanace jwa Age jwa ku Halali. Ndaŵi jine Afilisiti ŵasongene ku Lehi kuwaliji mgunda ŵa mbelemende. Ni Aisalaeli ŵatisile Afilisitiwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Sama ŵajimi pakatikati pa mgundawo ni ŵawucenjele, soni ŵawuleje Afilisitiwo, ligongo AMBUJE ŵapundikasisye kwa amagongowo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masiku gagowola, ŵatatu mwa ŵa ngondo ŵakupikanika makumi gatatu gala, ŵapite kwa Daudi ku mbanga ja Adulamu, pelepo likuga lya ngondo lya Afilisiti lyataŵaga masakasa gawo ku Ciŵata ca Lefayimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pelepo ni kuti Daudi ŵaliji mu mbanga mula, ni likuga lya ngondo lya Afilisiti lyaliji ku Betelehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano Daudi ŵaŵecete mwakumbila kuti, “Ha! Akambe jwine mesi gakumwa ga pa cisima cicili pa cipata ku Betelehemu kuti mwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apo ŵandu ŵatatu ŵamacili ŵala ŵajawile kupitila ku masakasa ga Afilisiti, ni kuteka pa cisima ca ku Betelehemu, cicaliji pakuŵandikana ni cipata. Ŵajigele mesigo ni ŵayice nago kwa Daudi. Nambo Daudijo nganasaka kumwa kose mesigo, ŵagambile kwitila pasi, kugapeleka kwa AMBUJE, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni ŵatite, “Ngulumbila kwa AMBUJE, nginimba ndesile cindu celeci, ligongo tiyiŵe mpela kumwa miasi ja ŵandu ŵele ŵaŵisile umi wawo pa ucece.” Mwamti ŵakanile kumwa mesigo. Yeleyi ni ŵatesile ŵandu ŵatatu ŵamacili ŵala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano Abishayi, mlongo mjawo jwa Yowabu, mwanace jwa Seluya, ni juŵaliji jwakulongolela jwa ŵandu makumi gatatu gala. Ŵawuleje ŵandu 300 ni lipanga lyakwe, ni ŵapikanice mpela ŵandu ŵatatu ŵala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵaliji ŵakupikanika mnope kwa ŵandu makumi gatatu ŵala, ni ŵatemi kuŵa ŵakulungwa ŵawo, nambo nganiŵayika ŵatatu ŵala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya mwanace jwa Yehoyada jwakutyocela ku Kabisele ŵaliji mundu jwakulimba mtima; ŵatesile yejinji yakusimonjesya pakwawulaga acakulungwa ŵaŵili ŵa ngondo ŵa cilambo ca Mowabu. Lisiku line kusa kuli mkusisima ŵajinjile mwisimbo ni ŵawuleje lisimba mwelemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵawuleje soni mundu jwine jwa ku Iguputo, jwakuwoneka mwakusalala. Mundujo jwakwete lipanga m'myala mwakwe. Benaya ŵapite kwa mundujo ali ajigele mpici ni ŵasumwile lipanga kutyocela m'myala mwa mundu jwa ku Iguputojo, nipo ŵamwuleje ni lipanga lyakwe lilyolyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeleyi ni yiŵatesile Benaya mwanace jwa Yehoyada ni ŵapikanice mpela acimlongola ŵane makumi gatatu gala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya ŵaliji ŵakupikanika sikati ja ŵa ngondo makumi gatatu ŵala nambope nganapayika pa asilikali ŵatatu ŵala. Daudi ŵamŵisile Benaya kuŵa jwakulamulila asilikali ŵakwalondela mwenyewo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
